[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4hR"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"\u003c@U02GD5GRJ72\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632871669.299500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"自分もvim-lspのコード読んでみて、user_dataの{“vim-lsp/key”: “0\"} に初期化されるタイミングが何かなーと言うのを見てみると、CompleteDoneが呼ばれた時になるんだというところまでは理解できました。\nカッコを入力するとuser_dataがゼロになっているので、CompleteDone は飛んでいると思うんですけど、その辺を今日は勉強したいと思います。","ts":"1632870369.299300","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[September 29th, 2021 12:23 AM] heavenshell: 雑に vim-lsp のコードリーディングしてたんですが、 \u003chttps://github.com/prabirshrestha/vim-lsp/blob/7b9da239da68e21aacc96cb77b44b5a669038b2b/autoload/lsp/ui/vim/completion.vim#L31\u003e\nおそらく CompleteDone のイベントが飛んできたら、いろいろやって、最終的に additionalTextEdits があれば、それを実行して挿入してるのかな？","author_id":"U78A6ESHM","author_name":"heavenshell","author_subname":"heavenshell","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U78A6ESHM","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2019-11-14/833953864853_aa245483338df08cd3b2_48.png","text":"雑に vim-lsp のコードリーディングしてたんですが、 \u003chttps://github.com/prabirshrestha/vim-lsp/blob/7b9da239da68e21aacc96cb77b44b5a669038b2b/autoload/lsp/ui/vim/completion.vim#L31\u003e\nおそらく CompleteDone のイベントが飛んできたら、いろいろやって、最終的に additionalTextEdits があれば、それを実行して挿入してるのかな？","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-lsp","ts":1632842617.263200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CQ57P4XU4/p1632842617263200"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gd="}]},{"client_msg_id":"99ceea54-0071-4c06-ac44-7f6095bf2c65","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"という、しちめんどうくさいことをやるのが一番正確です。。。","ts":"1632848440.299000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S1q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58816643-3f14-4d72-8053-fb71815231f6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. textEdit の start.character を使うのは基本的に正しい\n2. もし、start.character が複数のアイテムで別々の値として返却された場合「一番左端の値を、補完開始位置として採用する」「一番左端じゃない場合、足りない値だけ文字を足してやる」という対応が必要","ts":"1632848402.298200","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1632848421.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Icm5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be166437-d67f-48d9-a7cc-5f000f82dc5c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"もしかしたら、これも完璧なソリューションではないかもです。\nオムニ補完なのでそこそこリッチに対応しても許されるかもしれないので他のポイントについて。","ts":"1632848266.294200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XHj=L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"578e56ee-580f-4360-b56b-6ee0d3c41437","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"むちゃくちゃ体験が良くなりました！ありがとうございます！","ts":"1632847478.292000","files":[{"id":"F02FV7QE4P7","created":1632847464,"timestamp":1632847464,"name":"Kapture 2021-09-29 at 01.44.06.mp4","title":"Kapture 2021-09-29 at 01.44.06.mp4","mimetype":"video/mp4","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"mp4","pretty_type":"MPEG 4ビデオ","user":"U78A6ESHM","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":768317,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02FV7QE4P7-5764cff122/kapture_2021-09-29_at_01.44.06.mp4","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02FV7QE4P7/download/kapture_2021-09-29_at_01.44.06.mp4","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U78A6ESHM/F02FV7QE4P7/kapture_2021-09-29_at_01.44.06.mp4","permalink_public":"htt