iginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T3HLt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28e6b6fa-daf2-4bd8-af1a-e3cdf2cc21ad","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"一つ不安なのが、これが deno に特化した話なのかどうなのかが分からなくて。なので LS ごとに設定できればいいのかなーと思ってたんですが、他に影響なく行けるのであればとてもありがたいです :bow:\nブランチ作るのがアレなのであれば、パッチをいただけたら、手元で試してみます！","ts":"1632844904.283100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ool"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00f43793-c683-482a-9049-9c93856e406d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やはり textEdit のいち合わせですね。どうしよう。試しにブランチ作ってご案内してみましょうか？","ts":"1632844728.280400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zf="}]},{"client_msg_id":"21e72d0e-451c-4736-add3-db25d3752c09","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たしかに、自前のやつでも同じ動きをしました。（coc と）","ts":"1632844709.279900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DsOP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f8d1a9a-9ba7-4083-bbbe-aa5c51d832cd","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"現状まともに動いてないので vim-lsp-settings に入れてないやつです","ts":"1632844607.279600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZXBi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3322eae6-2a72-44db-8adf-8a986736bfc3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```      \\   \"suggest\": {\n      \\     \"autoImports\": v:true,\n      \\     \"completeFunctionCalls\": v:true,\n      \\     \"names\": v:true,\n      \\     \"paths\": v:true,\n      \\     \"imports\": {\n      \\       \"autoDiscover\": v:false,\n      \\       \"hosts\": {\n      \\         \"\u003chttps://deno.land/\u003e\": v:true,\n      \\       },\n      \\     },\n      \\   },```\ninitialization_options にこう言うのが必要ですー","ts":"1632844588.279200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","bloc